# @req REQ-GEN-COV-HIRDECL
"""
# MC/DC coverage: declaration_lowering.spl

Target: src/compiler/20.hir/hir_lowering/_Items/declaration_lowering.spl
(`hir_lower_diag_enabled`, `hir_generic_fn_is_template`,
`declaration_span_for`, `lower_bootstrap_flat_function`, `lower_function`,
`lower_struct`, `lower_field_with_type`, `lower_enum_with_symbol`,
`lower_variant_declared_type`, `scope_binds_type_symbol`, `lower_variant`,
`lower_bitfield`, `fn_has_untyped_value_param`).
Every compound decision drives each condition to independently flip the
outcome; every single-condition decision takes both outcomes. Env-gated
decisions (SIMPLE_BOOTSTRAP, SIMPLE_COMPILER_TRACE, SIMPLE_BOOTSTRAP_DIAG)
set the variable for one example and restore the previous value.

## Decision inventory

| Line | Decision | Conditions | Covering its |
|------|----------|------------|--------------|
| 71 | `trace == "1"` | c1 | L71 T (trace) / F (diag only, neither) |
| 92 | `type_param_count == 0` | c1 | L92 T / F |
